TP_GPIO_016,Negedge - Walking Zeros Pattern,Validate negedge interrupts with walking-zeros stimulus across pads.,As in TP_GPIO_002.,1) Generate pattern where one pad transitions high->low per time step; others static high. 2) Step through all pads.,Exactly one interrupt per step corresponding to active pad.,Pattern,PSVValidation,P2,Stimulus pattern coverage,Baremetal on PSV target,0x16,GPIO_Pattern,https://github.com/titusbspgit/PSVValidation/tree/main/TestRepo/gpio/test_gpio_nedge_walking_zeros_pattern
