TP_GPIO_020,GPIO Soft Reset,Validate GPIO_SW_RESET clears configuration and status registers and returns to defaults.,SoC powered.,1) Program non-default values in GPIO_DIR, GPIO_DATA_OUT, GPIO_INT_EN, INT_TYPE, INT_POL. 2) Assert GPIO_SW_RESET. 3) Read back all registers.,All registers at documented reset values; pending interrupts cleared; pads disabled.,Reset,PSVValidation,P0,Reset behavior coverage,Baremetal on PSV target,0x20,GPIO_Reset,https://github.com/titusbspgit/PSVValidation/tree/main/TestRepo/gpio/test_gpio_sft_rst